    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase C2: RBAC diagnostics tests for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_i_metadata_security_provider" kindref="compound">IMetadataSecurityProvider</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Test IDs: MCH-SEC01..MCH-SEC04</para>
</simplesect>
MCH-SEC01 ADMIN grant implies READ_SCHEMA on the granted resource MCH-SEC02 revoke() removes a specific grant, leaving others intact MCH-SEC03 revokeAll() removes all grants for a principal MCH-SEC04 hasPermission() returns false after revoke (no exception thrown)</para>
<para>Self-contained: header-only types, no RocksDB, no network I/O. Canonical PRNG seed: kRbacSeed = 42.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="imetadata__security__provider_8h" kindref="compound">include/metadata/imetadata_security_provider.h</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>src/metadata/ROADMAP.md — Phase C diagnostics items </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
